Please note a very important distinction between different sections of
text throughout this document. There are two distinctive kinds of
text: informative comment and normative statements. Because most of
the text in this specification will be of the kind normative
statements, the authors have informally defined it as the default and,
as such, have specifically called out text of the kind informative
comment. They have done this by flagging the beginning and end of each
