   <td>uint
   </td>
   <td>SHALL be 0x46444F31 ("FDO1"). Identifies this NV data as an FDO
DCTPM structure version 1. Readers MUST verify this value before
interpreting subsequent fields.
<p>
See CBOR definition of DCTPM: [[#FDOCRED]].
   </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
