specification, TO1 client implementations SHALL always behave as
though the <code>rvserver.local</code> directive is present, even if
it is not explicitly stored in DCRVInfo.  Consequently, Device
Initialization clients MAY omit the <code>rvserver.local</code>
entry from DCRVInfo to conserve TPM NV storage space.
